-claim-row=\"obligations:obligation:72916-002\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\">\n        <div class=\"node-record-main\">Deliver to the mayor and council speaker and publicly post a plan describing the scope and implementation of the truth and reconciliation process. <a class=\"edge-prov-why edge-prov-why-exact edge-prov-cross-spine-unmatched\" data-edge-claim=\"obligations:obligation:72916-002\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\" data-cross-spine-confidence=\"unmatched\" href=\"/agencies/commission-on-racial-equity/?claim=obligations%3Aobligation%3A72916-002\" aria-label=\"View connection details\" title=\"View connection evidence\"><span class=\"edge-prov-details-label edge-prov-confidence-unmatched\">Details</span></a></div>\n        <span class=\"muted node-muted\">Expected; no matching evidence in current sources · Report, study, or plan publication or filing · report · deadline: Not later than June 19, 2024 · one-time · § 8-1103(b)</span>\n      </li><li class=\"node-record\" data-obligation-id=\"72916-013\" data-edge-claim-row=\"obligations:obligation:72916-013\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\">\n        <div class=\"node-record-main\">Issue terms and guidelines for creating and protecting a physically and psychologically secure truth and reconciliation space and process. <a class=\"edge-prov-why edge-prov-why-exact edge-prov-cross-spine-unmatched\" data-edge-claim=\"obligations:obligation:72916-013\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\" data-cross-spine-confidence=\"unmatched\" href=\"/agencies/commission-on-racial-equity/?claim=obligations%3Aobligation%3A72916-013\" aria-label=\"View connection details\" title=\"View connection evidence\"><span class=\"edge-prov-details-label edge-prov-confidence-unmatched\">Details</span></a></div>\n        <span class=\"muted node-muted\">Expected; no matching evidence in current sources · Agency Rules filing (proposal, hearing, adoption, or notice) · rulemaking · one-time · § 8-1105(b)</span>\n      </li><li class=\"node-record\" data-obligation-id=\"72916-016\" data-edge-claim-row=\"obligations:obligation:72916-016\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\">\n        <div class=\"node-record-main\">Publish a report on the history and legacies of slavery in New York City, documenting process findings and recommending steps for addressing, repairing, and combating race-based discrimination and injustice. <a class=\"edge-prov-why edge-prov-why-exact edge-prov-cross-spine-unmatched\" data-edge-claim=\"obligations:obligation:72916-016\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\" data-cross-spine-confidence=\"unmatched\" href=\"/agencies/commission-on-racial-equity/?claim=obligations%3Aobligation%3A72916-016\" aria-label=\"View connection details\" title=\"View connection evidence\"><span class=\"edge-prov-details-label edge-prov-confidence-unmatched\">Details</span></a></div>\n        <span class=\"muted node-muted\">Expected; no matching evidence in current sources · Report, study, or plan publication or filing · report · deadline: No later than one year following the conclusion of the truth and reconciliation process · one-time · § 8-1107</span>\n      </li><li class=\"node-record\" data-obligation-id=\"72916-008\" data-edge-claim-row=\"obligations:obligation:72916-008\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\">\n        <div class=\"node-record-main\">Conduct a public outreach and information campaign in consultation with the Civic Engagement Commission and the Office of Ethnic and Community Media. <a class=\"edge-prov-why edge-prov-why-exact edge-prov-cross-spine-unmatched\" data-edge-claim=\"obligations:obligation:72916-008\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\" data-cross-spine-confidence=\"unmatched\" href=\"/agencies/commission-on-racial-equity/?claim=obligations%3Aobligation%3A72916-008\" aria-label=\"View connection details\" title=\"View connection evidence\"><span class=\"edge-prov-details-label edge-prov-confidence-unmatched\">Details</span></a></div>\n        <span class=\"muted node-muted\">Awaiting an evidence detector · Program action or operational milestone · program · deadline 2025-04-10 · ongoing · § 8-1105(a)</span>\n      </li><li class=\"node-record\" data-obligation-id=\"72916-009\" data-edge-claim-row=\"obligations:obligation:72916-009\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\">\n        <div class=\"node-record-main\">Create educational materials tailored to people of different ages and backgrounds as part of the public information campaign. <a class=\"edge-prov-why edge-prov-why-exact edge-prov-cross-spine-unmatched\" data-edge-claim=\"obligations:obligation:72916-009\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\" data-cross-spine-confidence=\"unmatched\" href=\"/agencies/commission-on-racial-equity/?claim=obligations%3Aobligation%3A72916-009\" aria-label=\"View connection details\" title=\"View connection evidence\"><span class=\"edge-prov-details-label edge-prov-confidence-unmatched\">Details</span></a></div>\n        <span class=\"muted node-muted\">Awaiting an evidence detector · Statutory duty event · other · deadline 2025-04-10 · ongoing · § 8-1105(a)(1)</span>\n      </li><li class=\"node-record\" data-obligation-id=\"72916-010\" data-edge-claim-row=\"obligations:obligation:72916-010\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\">\n        <div class=\"node-record-main\">Create resources for specified professional and community audiences as part of the public information campaign. <a class=\"edge-prov-why edge-prov-why-exact edge-prov-cross-spine-unmatched\" data-edge-claim=\"obligations:obligation:72916-010\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\" data-cross-spine-confidence=\"unmatched\" href=\"/agencies/commission-on-racial-equity/?claim=obligations%3Aobligation%3A72916-010\" aria-label=\"View connection details\" title=\"View connection evidence\"><span class=\"edge-prov-details-label edge-prov-confidence-unmatched\">Details</span></a></div>\n        <span class=\"muted node-muted\">Awaiting an evidence detector · Statutory duty event · other · deadline 2025-04-10 · ongoing · § 8-1105(a)(2)</span>\n      </li><li class=\"node-record\" data-obligation-id=\"72916-011\" data-edge-claim-row=\"obligations:obligation:72916-011\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\">\n        <div class=\"node-record-main\">Identify community outreach partners, stakeholders, and engagement opportunities as part of the public information campaign. <a class=\"edge-prov-why edge-prov-why-exact edge-prov-cross-spine-unmatched\" data-edge-claim=\"obligations:obligation:72916-011\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\" data-cross-spine-confidence=\"unmatched\" href=\"/agencies/commission-on-racial-equity/?claim=obligations%3Aobligation%3A72916-011\" aria-label=\"View connection details\" title=\"View connection evidence\"><span class=\"edge-prov-details-label edge-prov-confidence-unmatched\">Details</span></a></div>\n        <span class=\"muted node-muted\">Awaiting an evidence detector · Statutory duty event · other · deadline 2025-04-10 · ongoing · § 8-1105(a)(3)</span>\n      </li><li class=\"node-record\" data-obligation-id=\"72916-012\" data-edge-claim-row=\"obligations:obligation:72916-012\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\">\n        <div class=\"node-record-main\">Distribute and publicize campaign materials and resources through print, radio, internet, and public space as practicable. <a class=\"edge-prov-why edge-prov-why-exact edge-prov-cross-spine-unmatched\" data-edge-claim=\"obligations:obligation:72916-012\" data-warrant-class=\"exact\" data-cross-spine-confidence=\"unmatched\" href=\"/agencies/commission-on-racial-equity/?claim=obligations%3Aobligation%3A72916-012\" aria-label=\"View connection details\" title=\"View connection evidence\"><span class=\"edge-prov-details-label edge-prov-confidence-unmatched\">Details</span></a></div>\n        <span class=\"muted node-muted\">Awaiting an evidence detector · Public data or map publication · data publication · deadline 2025-04-10 · ongoing · § 8-1105(a)(4)</span>\n      </li></ul><details class=\"node-source-disclosure\"><summary class=\"node-action\">Open source laws</summar